# SNS Admin — Host Scope × Abilities

**작업 전:** `app/modules/moabom-social-auth/docs/ADMIN-HOST-SCOPE.md`

## SSOT (4계층)

1. `src/Support/SocialAuthAdminHostScope.php` — `host_scope` + `features.*`
2. `SocialAuthSettingsController::settingsAbilities()` — API merge
3. `SocialAuthSettingsService` + `StoreSocialAuthSettingsRequest` — 저장·검증
4. `resources/layouts/admin/admin_social_auth_settings.json` → `partials/social_auth/*`

## 필수 규칙

- 레이아웃/partial에서 호스트 문자열 직접 비교 금지
- UI 분기 = `abilities.features.*` 또는 `_computed.*` 만
- sub-tenant credential = `disabled` + `credentialInputClassName`
- 수정 = 활성 `app/modules/moabom-social-auth/` 만

## 새 scope/feature 추가 시

1. `SocialAuthAdminHostScope::resolve()` feature 추가
2. Service + FormRequest
3. layout `computed` + partial
4. Unit test + `ADMIN-HOST-SCOPE.md` 갱신
